  - THE MULTITOOL IS IMPORTED AS A MINI TOOL KIT, the catalog''''s nearest row -
    the same reading the Spacer took.
  - THE SMALL SPACESHIP IS NOT IMPORTED: "May own a small spaceship (or several
    characters can pool their resources and acquire a larger spaceship; G.M.''''s
    call)". Optional by the book''''s own wording, and `gear` has no shape for a
