  - THE RELATED-SKILL SCHEDULE STEPS 1/2/1/1 AT LEVELS 3, 6, 9 AND 12, where
    most of this book gives two at level three. Transcribed as printed.
  - Experience table transcribed from a 200 dpi render of printed 183, shared
    with the Galactic Tracer, the Imperial Security Agent and the Freedom
